  "org": "acme-commerce",
  "dataset": "spans",
  "stats_period": "30d",
  "traces_sample_rate": 0.25,
  "_comment": [
    "Offline fixture standing in for a real org snapshot, so the analyzer is",
    "testable with no credentials. Shaped to exercise the findings that actually",
    "show up in the field:",
    "",
    "  - a mid-funnel dark segment (payment_authorized absent)",
    "  - which is really NAME DRIFT: 'checkout.payment_authorize' IS being sent",
    "    43,800 times, while the spec binds the step to 'checkout.payment.authorize'.",
    "    One rename away from working. No error, no failing test, no data.",
    "  - a boolean outcome, so failed/abandoned/rejected collapse into one bucket",
    "  - cart.value sent as a STRING, so sum() and p50() silently return nothing",
    "  - no terminal confirmation span, which caps the grade",
    "  - a declared journey (subscription_upgrade) with the correlation key present",
    "    but no journey spans at all",
    "",
    "attributeSource.source_type is the real field from",
    "GET /trace-items/attributes/ — `user` means customer-defined, `sentry` means",
    "the SDK provided it."
  ],
